    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Daily Reminders\nEvery day at 09:00 (Africa/Banjul), find clients still missing documents and send reminder 1, reminder 2, or a staff escalation. Each step happens once.\n**Off by default until the demo:** activating it emails every waiting client.",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 496,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -64,
        -336
      ],
      "id": "cc102a23-824a-46fa-99d8-6f4c7a3c226c",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Triggers and config\nTwo ways to start: the daily schedule and a manual button for testing.\n**Thresholds in SetConfig:** reminder 1 at 2 days, reminder 2 at 5, escalation at 7. Tune them here, never in code.",
        "height": 496,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "3c14c7f8-a154-401b-a642-cd331acd6d93",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Find and decide\n**Logic:** pick the furthest step that is due and not yet recorded. Past day 7 with no reminders goes straight to escalation (deliberate simplification).\n**Why it never repeats:** each step writes its own timestamp, and the code skips steps already done.\n**Fails loudly:** a row with no id throws, so staff are alerted",
        "height": 496,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        432,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "b7ca2fbf-80ab-4dad-a565-ec6cfebed370",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Route\nSwitch sends each client down one path. Clients with nothing due produce no item at all.",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 208
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        896,
        -64
      ],
      "id": "72cec7f0-ac88-44f1-887d-8724f6439736",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 6. Escalation\nEmail staff, set status \"escalated\" \n(stops repeat alerts),\n record the time, log it.",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 912,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        352
      ],
      "id": "4cc5992b-9cc1-4e87-b5d5-7e7f853678b0",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Reminder 2\n**Order:** send email,\n record timestamp, log. \nRetry On Fail on the email.\n",
